+| Column | Small | float32 | 0.178 | 0.632 | 0.719 | 0.666 | 0.27× | 3.3% | 0.050 |
+| Column | Medium | bfloat16 | 13.382 | 7.416 | 4.250 | 2.692 | 4.97× | 62.1% | 0.798 |
